title: February 2023

@february_2023_hub
# prose-audit: Grade C — All three files are compressed to a headline: the presidential referral is one sentence, the Wolnościowcy split two, the Left cooperation agreement two. Ten choices then close on one short analytical paragraph each. The material is right and the scene is missing — this desk needs the treatment march_2023 and may_2023 already have.
title: Presidential vetoes and election plans
face-image: img/poland/events/presidential-palace.webp
new-page: true

= February 2023

The Palace has stalled the judicial bill. At the same time Konfederacja is
shedding its libertarian dissenters, and we must decide which of our own
organisations will still share a ballot in October.

- @feb23_palace
- @feb23_konf
- @feb23_left
- @feb23_finish

@feb23_palace
title: President [+ president_name +] sends the judicial bill to the Tribunal
new-page: true
view-if: february_2023_palace_done = 0
on-arrival: february_2023_palace_done = 1

= The disputed court receives the bill

The presidential referral blocks the promised shortcut to KPO money.

- @feb23_negotiate
- @feb23_condemn
- @feb23_wait

@feb23_negotiate
title: Keep the Palace channel open for a replacement bill
on-arrival: president_relation += 3; constitutional_restraint += 2; kpo_delivery -= 1; ko_relation -= 2; news_headline = "The Left asks the Palace for a route around its own referral"

Lewica treats the referral as an obstacle to be managed rather than a break to
be denounced. The Palace now owns more of the route out, which preserves a
channel and risks making the president the author of any future compromise.

- @feb23_return: Return to the February desk

@feb23_condemn
title: Call the referral institutional sabotage
on-arrival: president_relation -= 5; ko_relation += 4; p2050_relation += 2; institutional_issue_salience += 4; public_trust += 1; news_headline = "The opposition blames the Palace for frozen recovery money"

The line is easy to explain and hard for the Palace to welcome. It places the
president beside the frozen money in the public mind, while narrowing any room
for him to later present himself as the exit from the crisis.

- @feb23_return: Return to the February desk

@feb23_wait
title: Stop spending political capital on PiS repair bills
on-arrival: kpo_delivery -= 2; public_trust -= 1; party_unity += 1; resources += 1; news_headline = "The Left saves its capacity for the election"

The party keeps its time, money and unity for the coming campaign instead of
another judicial argument written on PiS terms. Municipalities still waiting on
investment inherit the delay along with our saved capacity.

- @feb23_return: Return to the February desk

@feb23_konf
title: Wolnościowcy leave Konfederacja
new-page: true
view-if: february_2023_konf_done = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.february_2023_konf_done = 1;
const wolnosciowcyDeparting = Math.min(
    3,
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.konf_seats) || 0)
);
Q.konf_seats -= wolnosciowcyDeparting;
Q.other_seats += wolnosciowcyDeparting;
Q.wolnosciowcy_seats = wolnosciowcyDeparting;
Q.wolnosciowcy_status =
    "Independent parliamentary party outside Konfederacja";
Q.konf_org_resources += 1;
Q.konf_poll_momentum += 0.15;
!}

= A smaller but more unified Konfederacja

**Artur Dziambor**, **Jakub Kulesza** and **Dobromir Sośnierz** form a separate
parliamentary circle. The loss
of deputies also leaves Mentzen, the National Movement and Braun with firmer
control of Konfederacja.

- @feb23_expose
- @feb23_court
- @feb23_ignore

@feb23_expose
title: Show that the rupture removed restraints, not the radical currents
on-arrival: media_capacity += 2; far_right_agenda -= 1; konf_poll_momentum -= 0.1; p2050_relation += 1; news_headline = "The Left maps the currents left inside Konfederacja"

Lewica refuses to mistake a cleaner organisational diagram for moderation.
The split becomes evidence that the softer libertarian cover has left, while the
core nationalist and radical currents remain in command.

- @feb23_return: Return to the February desk

@feb23_court
title: Court the defectors for a democratic anti-PiS vote
on-arrival: p2050_relation -= 2; ko_relation -= 1; public_trust -= 1; rival_relation_konf_p2050 += 1; party_unity -= 1; news_headline = "A parliamentary vote opens an awkward libertarian channel"

The parliamentary arithmetic is real; so is the reputational cost. Voters now
have a photograph of Lewica probing for tactical votes among politicians it is
also trying to describe as a danger.

- @feb23_return: Return to the February desk

@feb23_ignore
title: Let the right consume its own split
on-arrival: konf_poll_momentum += 0.25; anti_establishment_youth_konf_affinity += 1; news_headline = "Konfederacja converts a split into tighter control"

The party saves its energy and leaves the right to its own quarrels. In public,
however, the visible result is not chaos but a more disciplined Konfederacja
with one fewer internal restraint on its message.

- @feb23_return: Return to the February desk

@feb23_left
title: The Left cooperation agreement
new-page: true
view-if: left_pact_2023_done = 0
on-arrival: left_pact_2023_done = 1

= One list, separate parties

[? if pps_party_formed = 1 or pps_in_left = 0: Nowa Lewica, Razem, PPS and
Unia Pracy can restore electoral cooperation without pretending that the 2021
merger absorbed them.?] [? if pps_party_formed = 0 and pps_in_left = 1: Nowa
Lewica, Razem, PPS and Unia Pracy can turn their internal settlement into an
electoral pact without dissolving the smaller organisations' identities.?]

- @feb23_autonomy
- @feb23_lead
- @feb23_social
- @feb23_delay

@feb23_autonomy
title: Guarantee party autonomy and transparent list shares
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The verification mechanism lacks capacity.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.left_electoral_pact = "Protected autonomous partners";
Q.party_unity += 6;
Q.razem_cooperation += 7;
Q.razem_dissent -= 6;
Q.barons_dissent += 3;
Q.public_trust += 2;
Q.pps_strength = Math.max(2, Number(Q.pps_exit_strength) || 2);
Q.pps_dissent = Math.min(30, Number(Q.pps_dissent) || 30);
Q.news_headline =
    "Four Left parties sign with autonomy guarantees and PPS returns as a tiny caucus";
!}
go-to: feb23_restore_pps

@feb23_lead
title: Put Nowa Lewica in command of one campaign
on-arrival: {!
Q.left_electoral_pact = "Nowa Lewica-led list";
Q.barons_strength += 3;
if (Q.spring_active) Q.spring_strength += 2;
else Q.progressives_strength += 2;
Q.barons_dissent -= 5;
Q.razem_dissent += 7;
Q.pps_dissent += 5;
Q.party_unity += 1;
Q.pps_strength = Math.max(1.5, Number(Q.pps_exit_strength) || 2);
Q.news_headline =
    "Nowa Lewica leads a list that retains a very small PPS caucus";
!}
go-to: feb23_restore_pps

@feb23_social
title: Write a PPS–Razem social floor above the branding
on-arrival: {!
Q.left_electoral_pact = "Common social floor";
Q.labor_credibility += 5;
Q.razem_cooperation += 5;
Q.labor_dissent -= 4;
Q.pps_dissent -= 12;
Q.barons_dissent += 4;
Q.budget_promises += 1;
Q.party_unity += 3;
Q.pps_strength = Math.max(3, Number(Q.pps_exit_strength) || 2);
Q.news_headline =
    "A PPS–Razem social floor reunites the parliamentary Left";
!}
go-to: feb23_restore_pps

@feb23_restore_pps
title: The pact takes organisational effect
on-arrival: {!
const returningPpsMps = Math.max(0, Number(Q.pps_party_seats) || 0);
const returningPpsSenators = Math.min(
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.pps_senate_seats) || 0),
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.senate_independent_seats) || 0)
);
Q.pps_active = 1;
Q.pps_in_left = 1;
Q.pps_org_status = "associated_current";
Q.pps_party_formed = 0;
Q.pps_demand_answered = 1;
Q.pps_escalation_stage = 0;
Q.left_seats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_seats) || 0) + returningPpsMps;
Q.left_pps_seats =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_pps_seats) || 0) + returningPpsMps;
Q.pps_party_seats = 0;
Q.senate_independent_seats =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.senate_independent_seats) || 0) -
        returningPpsSenators;
Q.senate_left_seats =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.senate_left_seats) || 0) + returningPpsSenators;
Q.pps_senate_seats = 0;
Q.seat_subvention_seats = Q.left_seats;
!}

[? if left_electoral_pact = "Protected autonomous partners": The agreement is
designed to keep everyone inside one campaign without pretending they are one
party. Razem and PPS regain a reason to stay while the Nowa Lewica apparatus
accepts that unity will be audited rather than merely declared.?]
[? if left_electoral_pact = "Nowa Lewica-led list": The pact restores a common
electoral vehicle, but under a visibly unequal chain of command. The campaign
is simpler to direct; the smaller partners now have to decide how much of that
simplicity is worth swallowing.?]
[? if left_electoral_pact = "Common social floor": Programme comes first and
branding second. That gives Razem and PPS a public reason to share a ballot,
while forcing the apparatus to campaign beneath promises it did not write alone.?]

- @feb23_return: Return to the February desk

@feb23_delay
title: Delay the agreement until list places are settled
on-arrival: left_electoral_pact = "Delayed over places"; party_unity -= 5; razem_dissent += 5; barons_dissent += 2; left_poll_momentum -= 0.2; opposition_list_pressure += 3; news_headline = "List arithmetic postpones Left unity"

The parties keep talking while the campaign clock keeps moving. Every district
now learns that list arithmetic can still outrank common purpose, which makes
later unity easier to question and harder to dramatise.

- @feb23_return: Return to the February desk

@feb23_return
title: Return to the February desk
go-to: february_2023_hub

@feb23_finish
title: Close the February desk
view-if: february_2023_palace_done = 1 and february_2023_konf_done = 1 and left_pact_2023_done = 1
on-arrival: february_2023_done = 1

The judicial bill goes to a Tribunal with every reason to keep it, Konfederacja
loses a wing and gains clarity, and the Left signs a cooperation agreement
whose real test will be the candidate lists. February closes eight months
before the election.

- @poland_hub: Continue
